{"2696930":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"FROM THE GROUND","steam_appid":2696930,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"detailed_description":"<br><br><i>FROM THE GROUND is a third-person multiplayer PVP shooter set in a cartoon world where fruits and vegetables have taken over the world. In this game, you play as one of 12 characters, also called &quot;Juicers,&quot; along with other players in a variety of game modes. <\/i><br><br><strong>Varied Environments<\/strong><br><br>Fruits and vegetables are not just simple foods you harvest from a field, but living beings that now dominate the world. These quirky beings call themselves &quot;Juicers,&quot; and they have only one thing in mind: fighting each other. <br>They clash in varied environments; farmlands, military bases, and undergrounds are part of their playground. Nothing can stops them. <br>Once they choose an area, the juice starts flowing !<br><br><strong>Fruit Salad<\/strong><br><br>Face off against other players in a free-for-all game mode where each elimination earns you a point.<br>The winner of the game is the player who reaches the maximum score limit or who has the highest score at the end of the allotted time.<br><br><strong>Team Death Match<\/strong><br><br>Face off against other players with your team until you have eliminated them all.<br>The winner of the game is the team that reaches the maximum score limit or who has the highest score at the end of the allotted time.","about_the_game":"<br><br><i>FROM THE GROUND is a third-person multiplayer PVP shooter set in a cartoon world where fruits and vegetables have taken over the world. In this game, you play as one of 12 characters, also called &quot;Juicers,&quot; along with other players in a variety of game modes. <\/i><br><br><strong>Varied Environments<\/strong><br><br>Fruits and vegetables are not just simple foods you harvest from a field, but living beings that now dominate the world. These quirky beings call themselves &quot;Juicers,&quot; and they have only one thing in mind: fighting each other. <br>They clash in varied environments; farmlands, military bases, and undergrounds are part of their playground. Nothing can stops them. <br>Once they choose an area, the juice starts flowing !<br><br><strong>Fruit Salad<\/strong><br><br>Face off against other players in a free-for-all game mode where each elimination earns you a point.<br>The winner of the game is the player who reaches the maximum score limit or who has the highest score at the end of the allotted time.<br><br><strong>Team Death Match<\/strong><br><br>Face off against other players with your team until you have eliminated them all.<br>The winner of the game is the team that reaches the maximum score limit or who has the highest score at the end of the allotted time.","short_description":"FROM THE GROUND is a third-person PvP Multiplayer shooter. Play as juicy characters and face off yourself on the battlefield in a wacky universe.","supported_languages":"영어<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>음성이 지원되는 언어","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2696930\/header.jpg?t=1757933572","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2696930\/3cd1f296f88b7b542eec7ac1d04bf537bc9021dc\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757933572","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2696930\/3cd1f296f88b7b542eec7ac1d04bf537bc9021dc\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757933572","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>최소:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>64비트 프로세서와 운영 체제가 필요합니다<br><\/li><li><strong>운영 체제:<\/strong> Windows 10<br><\/li><li><strong>프로세서:<\/strong> Intel core i5 2500 or AMD FX 8350<br><\/li><li><strong>메모리:<\/strong> 6 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>그래픽:<\/strong> GTX 650 2gb or R7 350 2gb<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> 버전 11<br><\/li><li><strong>저장 공간:<\/strong> 2 GB 사용 가능 공간<br><\/li><li><strong>사